 "remarks": "Welcome to 31 Hamilton Avenue! Located in Stamford, this charming 2-bedroom home offers comfortable interiors, an inviting outdoor space, and is a convenient five-minute walk to the train station.  The main level features a bright kitchen with abundant cabinetry, stainless-steel refrigerator, gas range, tile backsplash, recessed lighting, and space for casual dining. A separate dining room provides a warm setting for meals and entertaining. Upstairs, two generously sized bedrooms receive plenty of natural light, while the updated full bathroom includes a glass-enclosed shower and modern vanity. The unfinished basement offers laundry, utilities, storage, and flexible space for future use. Outside, enjoy a spacious backyard and elevated wood deck with room for dining, grilling, gardening, and relaxing.  With its practical layout, established residential setting, and convenient Stamford location. Come make this house your HOME! HOME IS SOLD AS-IS",
